===Notes===
*The final sentence of the description, "Additionally, all of your damage penalties from invisibility are permanently halved" does not refer to the talent named {{t|Invisibility}}, because as of version 1.7, that talent no longer causes a damage penalty. Some other sources of invisibility are still affected by this talent:
**Invisibility from activating an ethereal rune has a 50% damage penalty (reduced to 25%)
**Invisibility from activating [[Death's Embrace]] has a 50% damage penalty (reduced to 25%)
**Invisibility from deactivating {{t|Hymn of Detection}} while knowing {{t|Hymn Adept}} has a 40% damage penalty (reduced to 20%)